    <!-- Home - Wireless Adb -->
    <string name="home_wireless_adb_title"><![CDATA[透過無線偵錯啟動]]></string>
    <string name="home_wireless_adb_description"><![CDATA[在 Android 11 或更高版本上，您可以直接從您的裝置啟用無線偵錯並啟動 Porter，無須與電腦連線。<p>請先檢視分步驟指南。]]></string>
    <string name="home_wireless_adb_description_pre_11"><![CDATA[在 Android 11 之前，必須與電腦連線才能啟用無線偵錯。]]></string>
    <string name="home_wireless_adb_view_guide_button">分步驟指南</string>
    <!-- Adb -->
    <string name="dialog_adb_discovery">正在尋找無線偵錯服務</string>
    <string name="dialog_adb_discovery_message">請在「開發人員選項」中啟用「無線偵錯」功能。在切換網路時，「無線偵錯」會自動停用。\n\n注意：請不要停用「開發人員選項」或「USB
        偵錯」，否則 Porter 會被停止。</string>
    <string name="dialog_adb_discovery_message_toggle_wireless_debugging">如果一直搜尋，請嘗試停用並啟用「無線偵錯」。</string>
    <string name="dialog_adb_port">通訊埠</string>
